  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n## 10.0.0.4-Beta-02 - 2026-10-22\n_ Added new method ValidateApiAppKeyCredentialsAsync in ApiCredentialValidatorService class\n\n## 10.0.0.4-Beta-01 - 2026-10-14\n_ Updated GetSystemInfoAsync to two overloaded methods\n\n## 10.0.0.3-Beta-01 - 2026-10-05\n\n- Fixed SaveSystemInfoAsync to use MySQL-compatible upsert syntax.\n\n## 10.0.0.4-Beta-03 - 2026-10-05\n\n- Update package version MySqlConnector because MySqlConnector: Account password disclosed to a man-in-the-middle in zero-configuration TLS mode (clear-text password sent before certificate is verified)\n## 10.0.0.3 - 2026-10-05\n\n- Fixed SaveSystemInfoAsync to use MySQL-compatible upsert syntax.\n\n## 10.0.0.2 - 2026-08-24\n\n- dotnet 10 migration and updated github actions\n\n## 10.0.0.1 - 2026-08-14\n\n- release package of version 10.0.0.0-Beta-03",
